{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-sidebar-views#card-zh","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-sidebar-views","commit":"b751a5193b97767982626138d4f979db0ac9d6cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sidebar-views 是面向 DSH Web 的侧栏会话整理插件。它将纯 DOM 界面注入工作区侧栏，可在原生工作区树和按最近活动排序的历史会话视图间切换。主要功能包括固定会话、按工作区或外部调用分组、标题筛选、状态与时间提示、复制会话 ID，以及从菜单打开工作区目录；缺失标题可由宿主索引补全。适合需要整理大量交互或自动化会话的 Web 用户。无需额外账号或 API 密钥；固定和分组状态保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1009-1080","client/client.js:983-1007","src/index.js:222-280"]}
{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-sidebar-views#card-en","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-sidebar-views","commit":"b751a5193b97767982626138d4f979db0ac9d6cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Sidebar Views adds a switcher between workspaces and recent sessions in the DSH Web sidebar. It provides pinned sessions, workspace and external-call groups, title filtering, status labels, ID copying, and workspace folder access. Preferences use browser localStorage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1009-1080","client/client.js:983-1007","src/index.js:222-280"]}
